Terminals which are not used

   BHUMI
   NIYAM
   MAYA
   LBRACKET
   RBRACKET


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: declarations functions main_function

    2 main_function: SANKALPA LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

    3 declarations: /* empty */
    4             | declarations declaration SEMICOLON

    5 declaration: type IDENTIFIER
    6            | type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

    7 functions: /* empty */
    8          | functions function_declaration

    9 function_declaration: YAJNA type IDENTIFIER LPAREN parameters RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   10 parameters: /* empty */
   11           | parameter_list

   12 parameter_list: parameter
   13               | parameter_list COMMA parameter

   14 parameter: type IDENTIFIER

   15 statements: /* empty */
   16           | statements statement

   17 statement: declaration SEMICOLON
   18          | assignment SEMICOLON
   19          | conditional
   20          | loop
   21          | for_loop
   22          | TYAGA SEMICOLON
   23          | NIVRITTI SEMICOLON
   24          | function_call SEMICOLON
   25          | MOKSHA expression SEMICOLON
   26          | input_output SEMICOLON
   27          | try_catch_block

   28 try_catch_block: PRAYASCHITTA LBRACE statements RBRACE SHANTI LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   29 assignment: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

   30 conditional: DHARMA LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
   31            | DHARMA LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE ADHARMA LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
   32            | DHARMA LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE else_if_blocks ADHARMA LBRACE statements RBRACE

   33 else_if_blocks: else_if_blocks else_if_block
   34               | else_if_block

   35 else_if_block: VIKALPA LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   36 loop: TAPAS LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   37 for_loop: YATRA LPAREN for_initialization SEMICOLON for_condition SEMICOLON for_increment RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   38 for_initialization: /* empty */
   39                   | assignment
   40                   | declaration

   41 for_condition: /* empty */
   42              | expression

   43 for_increment: /* empty */
   44              | assignment

   45 expression: term
   46           | expression YOGA term
   47           | expression VIYOGA term
   48           | expression VIBHAGA term
   49           | expression LT term
   50           | expression GT term
   51           | expression LE term
   52           | expression GE term
   53           | expression EQ term
   54           | expression NE term

   55 term: factor
   56     | term BAL factor
   57     | term VIBHAJAN factor
   58     | term SHESHA factor
   59     | term SAMAVAYA factor

   60 factor: LPAREN expression RPAREN
   61       | IDENTIFIER
   62       | literal
   63       | function_call

   64 literal: INTEGER_LITERAL
   65        | STRING_LITERAL
   66        | FLOAT_LITERAL

   67 function_call: AHVANA LPAREN arguments RPAREN

   68 arguments: /* empty */
   69          | argument_list

   70 argument_list: expression
   71              | argument_list COMMA expression

   72 input_output: SHRAVANA LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN
   73             | MANTRA LPAREN expression RPAREN

   74 type: ARTHA
   75     | JALA
   76     | SATYA
   77     | AKSHARA
   78     | VANI


